      "text": "Two-tier oracle for `nucleide.spectroscopy`: synthetic E1-E8 gates on hand-built fixtures (tier 1, always run), and a cross-check against the upstream `pyne.spectanalysis` / `pyne.gammaspec` routines on identical runtime inputs (tier 2)."
